slug": "train-driver-2", "summary": "Train Driver 2 is a project simulating the role of a driver and dispatcher created by the TTSK association.\n\nAs a driver, you can sit at the controls of one of the locomotives and travel both real and fictional routes. Your task is to choose the composition and type of train and set off on the route, remaining in communication with other players. In addition, you can change the role and take on the role of a traffic controller, then your duties will include organizing work at the railway station, supervising the safe conduct of train traffic on railway routes, issuing timetables. There are many stations and control panels to choose from, it is only up to you which option you choose.", "themes": [{"id": 28, "name": "Business"}, {"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/train-driver-2"}